@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #334155
    ActorBorderColor #334155
    LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    ParticipantBorderColor #334155
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantFontSize 11
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
}

box "Physical Field Operational Plane (Data Plane)" #F8FAFC
    participant "Industrial Bus / Sensor\n(Modbus RTU / CAN / Eth)" as Fieldbus
    participant "STM32F407RE MCU\n(libmicroshield C99)" as EdgeNode
end box

box "Agnostic Out-of-Band Transport" #FFFFFF
    participant "Physical / Virtual Link\n(UART 8N1 / 4G / LoRa / TCP)" as Transport
end box

box "Fleet Supervision & MLOps Governance (Control Plane)" #F8FAFC
    participant "dashield-collector\n(Python Async Bridge)" as Collector
    participant "ShadowAuditEnsembleService\n(100-Tree Host Random Forest)" as ShadowAuditor
    participant "Dashield Web Console\n(SecOps Analyst UI :8501)" as UI
end box

== 1. Channel Synchronization & Protocol Handshake ==

Collector -> Transport : Probe Transport Endpoint (/dev/ttyACM0 or TCP:9999)
Transport -> EdgeNode : Check Physical Line / Send Sync Ping (0xAA55)
EdgeNode --> Transport : Emit 24B Node Descriptor (Magic: 0xAA55, NodeID: 0x01, State: NORMAL)
Transport --> Collector : Stream Validated (CRC-16 OK)
Collector -> UI : Mark Node 0x01 ONLINE (Physical HIL / Virtual Docker)

== 2. Inline Frame Ingestion & Asymmetric Telemetry Streaming ==

Fieldbus -> EdgeNode : Ingress Frame (Payload, Length, Timestamp)
activate EdgeNode
note over EdgeNode : Zero-Copy Inline Inspection:\n1. O(1) Sliding-Window Feature Extraction (Q8)\n2. O(tree_depth) Decision Tree Evaluation\n3. 5-State FSM Mitigation Update

alt Case A: Anomaly Detected (DoS Flood / Command Injection)
    note over EdgeNode #FEE2E2 : Verdict: ANOMALY_*\nFSM Escalation: SUSPICIOUS -> THROTTLED_L1\nPhysical Action: Immediate Packet DROP
    EdgeNode -> Transport : TX 24B Binary Alert Frame (msg_type=0x01, Verdict, RuleID, CRC-16)
    Transport -> Collector : Forward 24B Alert Frame
    Collector -> Collector : Verify CRC-16 & Write Record to SQLite WAL
    Collector -> UI : Push Live Anomaly Notification (RuleID, Feature Trace)
else Case B: Benign Frame & Stratified Shadow Sampling (1:K or Margin < Epsilon)
    note over EdgeNode #ECFDF5 : Verdict: BENIGN_TRAFFIC\nPhysical Action: Frame Forwarded to Actuator
    EdgeNode -> Transport : TX 24B Benign Audit Frame (msg_type=0x02, Vector, Margin, CRC-16)
    Transport -> Collector : Forward 24B Audit Frame
    Collector -> ShadowAuditor : Evaluate Vector against 100-Tree Reference Ensemble
    
    alt Ensemble Agrees: Benign
        ShadowAuditor -> Collector : No Action (Silently Update Baseline Covariance Metrics)
    else Ensemble Disagrees: Stealthy False Negative Detected (e.g. Setpoint Tampering)
        ShadowAuditor -> Collector : Discrepancy Found! (Discordance Score > 0.85)
        Collector -> Collector : Persist UNMASKED_FN in SQLite WAL Retraining Buffer
        Collector -> UI : Trigger High-Priority Alert: "Unmasked Stealthy FN (Cold-Chain Setpoint)"
    end
end
deactivate EdgeNode

== 3. Downlink Control & Operator False Positive Override ==

UI -> Collector : Operator Flags Alert as FP & Clicks "Override & Reset Node"
Collector -> Transport : TX 24B Command Frame (Magic: 0xAA55, msg_type=0x10, CMD_RESET_FSM, CRC-16)
Transport -> EdgeNode : RX Command Byte Stream
activate EdgeNode
EdgeNode -> EdgeNode : Validate CRC-16 & Authenticate Token
note over EdgeNode #FEF3C7 : FSM Reset Execution:\nTHROTTLED/LOCKDOWN -> NORMAL\nRe-enable RX Interrupt
EdgeNode --> Transport : TX 24B Ack Frame (FSM_State = NORMAL, CRC-16)
deactivate EdgeNode
Transport --> Collector : Forward State Ack
Collector -> UI : Update Fleet View: Node 0x01 Restored to NORMAL

@enduml
